aning":"阅读大卫的介绍并回答问题。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s002.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s001","speaker":"narrator","text":"C1 David is introducing some of his basketball teammates.","rects":[{"x":14.3627,"y":10.2356,"w":51.5589,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ˈwʌn ˈdeɪvɪd ɪz ˌɪntrəˈdjuːsɪŋ ˌsʌm ɒv hɪz ˈbɑːskɪtbɔːl ˈtiːmmeɪts./","meaning":"C1大卫正在介绍他的一些篮球队友。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s001.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s003","speaker":"narrator","text":"I’m in the school basketball team.","rects":[{"x":17.4219,"y":16.5485,"w":32.5823,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪm ɪn ðə ˈskuːl ˈbɑːskɪtbɔːl ˈtiːm./","meaning":"我在学校篮球队。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s003.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s004","speaker":"narrator","text":"My teammates are great!","rects":[{"x":50.5965,"y":16.5485,"w":3.1354,"h":1.7375},{"x":17.4219,"y":18.5383,"w":19.8197,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌmaɪ ˈtiːmmeɪts ɑː ˈgreɪt!/","meaning":"我的队友是伟大的！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s004.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s005","speaker":"narrator","text":"Tom is tall and thin.","rects":[{"x":17.4219,"y":21.2795,"w":19.5989,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈtɒm ɪz ˈtɔːl ænd ˈθɪn./","meaning":"汤姆高而瘦。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s005.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s007","speaker":"narrator","text":"He always gets the ball!","rects":[{"x":53.4368,"y":21.2795,"w":2.6669,"h":1.7375},{"x":17.4219,"y":23.2694,"w":19.1778,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌhiː ˈɔːlweɪz gets ðə ˈbɔːl!/","meaning":"他总是得到球！","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s007.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s006","speaker":"narrator","text":"He can run fast.","rects":[{"x":37.6132,"y":21.2795,"w":15.2312,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌhiː kæn ˈrʌn ˈfɑːst./","meaning":"他能跑得快一点 He can run fast。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s006.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s008","speaker":"narrator","text":"John is kind and friendly.","rects":[{"x":17.4219,"y":26.0106,"w":24.5507,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈdʒɒn ɪz ˈkaɪnd ænd ˈfrendliː./","meaning":"约翰是善良和友好的。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s008.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s009","speaker":"narrator","text":"He’s a great basketball player.","rects":[{"x":42.565,"y":26.0106,"w":10.9419,"h":1.7375},{"x":17.4219,"y":28.0005,"w":16.5066,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌhiːz ə ˈgreɪt ˈbɑːskɪtbɔːl ˈpleɪə./","meaning":"他是一个出色的篮球运动员。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s009.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s010","speaker":"narrator","text":"He always puts the team first.","rects":[{"x":34.5209,"y":28.0005,"w":18.0756,"h":1.7375},{"x":17.4219,"y":29.9903,"w":9.7282,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌhiː ˈɔːlweɪz ˌpʊts ðə ˈtiːm ˈfɜːst./","meaning":"他总是把球队放在首位。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s010.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s011","speaker":"narrator","text":"Kevin is not tall, but he plays basketball well.","rects":[{"x":17.4219,"y":32.7315,"w":38.3205,"h":1.7375},{"x":17.4219,"y":34.7214,"w":4.5349,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ɪz ˌnɒt ˈtɔːl, ˌbʌt hiː ˈpleɪz ˈbɑːskɪtbɔːl ˈwel./","meaning":"凯文虽然不高，但他打篮球打得很好。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s011.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s012","speaker":"narrator","text":"He’s also good at many other sports, like football and ping-pong.","rects":[{"x":22.5492,"y":34.7214,"w":62.3738,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌhiːz ˈɔːlsəʊ ˈgʊd æt ˈmeniː ˈʌðə ˈspɔːts, ˈlaɪk ˈfʊtbɔːl ænd ˈpɪŋpɒŋ./","meaning":"他也擅长许多其他运动，如足球和乒乓球。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s012.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s013","speaker":"narrator","text":"Alex has a round face and wears glasses.","rects":[{"x":17.4219,"y":37.4626,"w":38.3123,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈælɪks hæz ə ˈraʊnd ˈfeɪs ænd ˈweəz ˈglɑːsɪz./","meaning":"亚历克斯有一个圆形的脸和戴眼镜。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s013.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s014","speaker":"narrator","text":"He likes basketball, but he does not play it very well.","rects":[{"x":56.3265,"y":37.4626,"w":30.0145,"h":1.7375},{"x":17.4219,"y":39.4525,"w":19.8815,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌhiː ˈlaɪks ˈbɑːskɪtbɔːl, ˌbʌt hiː ˈdʌz ˌnɒt ˈpleɪ ɪt ˈveriː ˈwel./","meaning":"他喜欢打篮球，但是打得不怎么好。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s014.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s015","speaker":"narrator","text":"He works hard to be good at it.","rects":[{"x":37.8957,"y":39.4525,"w":29.7276,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌhiː ˈwɜːks ˈhɑːd tə biː ˈgʊd æt ɪt./","meaning":"他努力工作 做它好。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s015.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s016","speaker":"narrator","text":"George is very smart and helpful.","rects":[{"x":17.4219,"y":42.1937,"w":31.9318,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˈdʒɔːdʒ ɪz ˈveriː ˈsmɑːt ænd ˈhelpfʊl./","meaning":"乔治非常聪明和有帮助。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s016.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s018","speaker":"narrator","text":"I learn a lot about the sport from him.","rects":[{"x":82.4479,"y":42.1937,"w":6.1779,"h":1.7375},{"x":17.4219,"y":44.1835,"w":29.9856,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌaɪ ˈlɜːn ə ˈlɒt əˈbaʊt ðə ˈspɔːt frɒm ˌhɪm./","meaning":"我从他那里学到了很多关于运动的知识","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s018.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s017","speaker":"narrator","text":"He helps me play basketball well.","rects":[{"x":49.9461,"y":42.1937,"w":31.9094,"h":1.7375}],"ipa":"/ˌhiː ˈhelps ˌmiː ˈpleɪ ˈbɑːskɪtbɔːl ˈwel./","meaning":"他帮我打篮球","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s017.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s019","speaker":"narrator","text":"1 Who can run fast?","rects":[{"x":15.1596,"y":49.7607,"w":20.3482,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈwʌn ˌhuː kæn ˈrʌn ˈfɑːst?/","meaning":"1谁能跑得快？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s019.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s020","speaker":"narrator","text":"2 Who always puts the team first?","rects":[{"x":15.1616,"y":54.4904,"w":33.5111,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈtuː ˌhuː ˈɔːlweɪz ˌpʊts ðə ˈtiːm ˈfɜːst?/","meaning":"2谁总是把球队放在首位？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s020.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s021","speaker":"narrator","text":"3 What sport is Kevin good at?","rects":[{"x":15.1616,"y":59.22,"w":30.4438,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈθriː ˌwɒt ˈspɔːt ɪz ˈgʊd æt?/","meaning":"3，凯文擅长什么运动？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s021.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s022","speaker":"narrator","text":"4 What does Alex look like?","rects":[{"x":15.1616,"y":63.9496,"w":27.5829,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈfɔː ˌwɒt ˈdʌz ˈælɪks ˈlʊk ˈlaɪk?/","meaning":"四，亚历克斯长什么样？","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s022.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s024","speaker":"narrator","text":"Use the information below to help you.","rects":[{"x":77.422,"y":71.8608,"w":6.6364,"h":2.0721},{"x":13.6009,"y":73.8501,"w":26.8871,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈjuːz ðiː ˌɪnfəˈmeɪʃən bɪˈləʊ tə ˈhelp juː./","meaning":"使用以下信息帮助您 。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s024.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s023","speaker":"narrator","text":"C2 Write an introduction to Tom, one of David’s basketball teammates.","rects":[{"x":14.2127,"y":71.8608,"w":62.7545,"h":2.0721}],"ipa":"/ˈsiː ˈtuː ˈraɪt ən ˌɪntrəˈdʌkʃən tə ˈtɒm, ˈwʌn ɒv ˈdeɪvɪdz ˈbɑːskɪtbɔːl ˈtiːmmeɪts./","meaning":"C2为大卫的篮球队队友之一汤姆写一个介绍。","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s023.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s027","speaker":"narrator","text":"Name: Tom","rects":[{"x":42.4202,"y":78.8209,"w":11.2165,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈneɪm: ˈtɒm/","meaning":"名称: Tom","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s027.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s028","speaker":"narrator","text":"Age: 12","rects":[{"x":42.4202,"y":81.1857,"w":7.3483,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈeɪdʒ: ˈtwelv/","meaning":"年龄:12岁","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s028.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s029","speaker":"narrator","text":"Looks: tall, thin","rects":[{"x":42.4202,"y":83.5505,"w":15.4376,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈlʊks: ˈtɔːl, ˈθɪn/","meaning":"外观:高，瘦","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s029.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s030","speaker":"narrator","text":"Hobbies: basketball, reading, singing","rects":[{"x":42.4202,"y":85.9153,"w":35.3709,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈhɒbiːz: ˈbɑːskɪtbɔːl, ˈriːdɪŋ, ˈsɪŋɪŋ/","meaning":"爱好:篮球、阅读、唱歌","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s030.wav"},{"id":"u11-p108-s031","speaker":"narrator","text":"Character: kind, friendly","rects":[{"x":42.4202,"y":88.2801,"w":24.0141,"h":1.7711}],"ipa":"/ˈkærɪktə: ˈkaɪnd, ˈfrendliː/","meaning":"字符: 亲切、友好","voice":"英式女声 · Emma","audio":"assets/audio/u11/u11-p108-s031.wav"}]}]}